      <p align="center"><big><font color="#FFFFFF">Charter:<br>
      </font></big><br>
      We, the adventurers of Norrath, in search of opportunities to meet and
      interact with like-minded souls, have chosen to unite under the banner of
      the Hessians of Morell-Thule.&nbsp;
      <p align="center">None here are the epitome of good or evil.
      We are the gray of Morell-Thule. Our services are for sale to better feed
      our hunger for adventure, slake our thirst for the occasional ale, and to
      assist those weaker than us in physical prowess yet mightier than us in
      the weight of their purse.&nbsp;
      <p align="center">Our honor is never questioned; it will be
      defended at all costs.</td>
